{
    "title": "Carrom Pool: Disc Game",
    "description": "Carrom Disc Pool is an easy-to-play multiplayer board game. Pot all your pieces before your opponent. Can you become the best at this Carrom Board game?\r\n\r\nWith simple gameplay, smooth controls and great physics, travel around the world and play against worthy opponents. Are you up for the challenge?\r\n\r\nThis game has multiple popular variants across the globe. Some to the most famous ones are Korona, Couronne, Bob, Crokinole, Pichenotte and Pitchnut. \r\n\r\nCustomise your pieces with a huge variety of unlock-able items! Show off your style to players from all over the world!\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\u25baPlay multiplayer matches in 3 game modes: Carrom, Free Style and Disc Pool\r\n\u25baPlay with your friends.\r\n\u25baCompete with top players.\r\n\u25baTry your luck at free daily golden shot and win big prizes.\r\n\u25baPlay around the world in glorious arenas.\r\n\u25baSmooth controls and realistic physics.\r\n\u25baUnlock a wide range of strikers and pucks.\r\n\u25baWin free victory chests with exciting rewards.\r\n\u25baUpgrade your strikers and unleash frenzy.\r\n\u25baSupports offline play.\r\n\r\nChallenge your friends in one-on-one matches and show what you are worth!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Carrom Disc Pool is an easy-to-play multiplayer board game. Pot all your pieces before your opponent. Can you become the best at this Carrom Board game?<br><br>With simple gameplay, smooth controls and great physics, travel around the world and play against worthy opponents. Are you up for the challenge?<br><br>This game has multiple popular variants across the globe. Some to the most famous ones are Korona, Couronne, Bob, Crokinole, Pichenotte and Pitchnut. <br><br>Customise your pieces with a huge variety of unlock-able items! Show off your style to players from all over the world!<br><br>Features:<br>\u25baPlay multiplayer matches in 3 game modes: Carrom, Free Style and Disc Pool<br>\u25baPlay with your friends.<br>\u25baCompete with top players.<br>\u25baTry your luck at free daily golden shot and win big prizes.<br>\u25baPlay around the world in glorious arenas.<br>\u25baSmooth controls and realistic physics.<br>\u25baUnlock a wide range of strikers and pucks.<br>\u25baWin free victory chests with exciting rewards.<br>\u25baUpgrade your strikers and unleash frenzy.<br>\u25baSupports offline play.<br><br>Challenge your friends in one-on-one matches and show what you are worth!",
    "summary": "Play the hit multiplayer Carrom Disc Pool board game and become the best!",
